{
    "title": "Universal TV Remote Control",
    "description": "\ud83d\udc4bAre you tired of constantly misplacing your TV remote, or having to dig through piles of clutter just to find TV control?\r\n\u2705Our Universal Remote Control for TV support most of major TV brands, it's the ultimate tool for anyone who values simplicity, convenience, and efficiency.\r\n\u2705Launch Free Universal TV Remote App in your phone, it's a smarts Android TV remote.\r\n\r\nReady to take your TV-watching experience to the next level?  \r\nOur TV Remote Control for All TV APP makes watching TV a breeze, say goodbye to the days of fumbling around in the dark for a lost remote.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Compatible with <b>over 20000+</b> tv models, control universal TV\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Need to use with <b>IR supported</b> android phone or tablet\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Rapid response\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Stable Connection\r\n\ud83d\udd25 <b>Fast setup to control universal smart tv</b>\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Step1: Search your TV models\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Step2: Download source pack of your TV remote\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Step3: Press button, remote control for tv\r\n\r\nTV Remote Control for All TV brands:\r\n <b>Fire stick remote, Samsung smart TV remote, LG TV remote, Apple TV remote, Insignia TV remote, Direct TV remote, Hisense TV remote, Panasonic TV remote, Toshiba TV remote, Vizio TV remote, Sony TV remote and most of Android TV remote. </b>\r\n\r\n<b>Disclaimer of Universal TV Remote:</b>\r\n*This Universal Remote Control for TV APP is not an official TV remote control product, and is not affiliated with the brands above in any way.\r\n*This Free Universal TV Remote requires IR blaster, make sure your phone support infrared (IR) emitter.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25So why wait? \r\nTry our Universal Remote Control for TV today and discover a whole new world of entertainment possibilities.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83d\udc4bAre you tired of constantly misplacing your TV remote, or having to dig through piles of clutter just to find TV control?<br>\u2705Our Universal Remote Control for TV support most of major TV brands, it&#39;s the ultimate tool for anyone who values simplicity, convenience, and efficiency.<br>\u2705Launch Free Universal TV Remote App in your phone, it&#39;s a smarts Android TV remote.<br><br>Ready to take your TV-watching experience to the next level?  <br>Our TV Remote Control for All TV APP makes watching TV a breeze, say goodbye to the days of fumbling around in the dark for a lost remote.<br><br>Key Features:<br>\ud83d\udd25 Compatible with <b>over 20000+</b> tv models, control universal TV<br>\ud83d\udd25 Need to use with <b>IR supported</b> android phone or tablet<br>\ud83d\udd25 Rapid response<br>\ud83d\udd25 Stable Connection<br>\ud83d\udd25 <b>Fast setup to control universal smart tv</b><br>\ud83d\ude80 Step1: Search your TV models<br>\ud83d\ude80 Step2: Download source pack of your TV remote<br>\ud83d\ude80 Step3: Press button, remote control for tv<br><br>TV Remote Control for All TV brands:<br> <b>Fire stick remote, Samsung smart TV remote, LG TV remote, Apple TV remote, Insignia TV remote, Direct TV remote, Hisense TV remote, Panasonic TV remote, Toshiba TV remote, Vizio TV remote, Sony TV remote and most of Android TV remote. </b><br><br><b>Disclaimer of Universal TV Remote:</b><br>*This Universal Remote Control for TV APP is not an official TV remote control product, and is not affiliated with the brands above in any way.<br>*This Free Universal TV Remote requires IR blaster, make sure your phone support infrared (IR) emitter.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25So why wait? <br>Try our Universal Remote Control for TV today and discover a whole new world of entertainment possibilities.",
